sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Admin
    participant Enrollment as Enrollment Service<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS mTLS
    participant Postgres as Postgres<br/>5432/TCP
    participant Operator as Operator<br/>9090/TCP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant SWIMPeer as SWIM Peers<br/>7946/UDP AES-256-GCM
    participant RemoteSignals as Remote Signal Endpoints<br/>HTTPS mTLS
    participant OverlaySync as overlay-sync Sidecar
    participant Gateway as Praxis Gateway
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Backend as Inference Backend

    rect rgb(232, 218, 239)
        Note over Admin, Postgres: Flow 1: Site Enrollment
        Admin->>Enrollment: POST /v1alpha1/enrollmenttokens<br/>mTLS client cert
        Enrollment->>Postgres: Store token
        Enrollment-->>Admin: Enrollment token
        Admin->>Enrollment: Distribute token to new site
        Note right of Enrollment: New site enrolls
        Operator->>Enrollment: POST /v1alpha1/enrollments<br/>Enrollment token + CSR
        Enrollment->>Enrollment: Validate token, sign CSR
        Enrollment->>Postgres: Record enrollment
        Enrollment-->>Operator: Signed mTLS certificate
    end

    rect rgb(214, 234, 248)
        Note over Operator, Gateway: Flow 2: Routing Overlay Computation
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Watch CRDs<br/>GridNetwork, GridSite,<br/>InferenceProvider, AgentToolProvider
        K8sAPI-->>Operator: CRD events
        Operator->>SWIMPeer: Gossip exchange<br/>7946/UDP AES-256-GCM
        SWIMPeer-->>Operator: Peer state (CRDTs)
        Operator->>RemoteSignals: Scrape health metrics<br/>mTLS
        RemoteSignals-->>Operator: Provider signals
        Note over Operator: Score providers<br/>(noMetrics / queueDepth / kvCachePressure)
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Write ConfigMap<br/>Routing overlay
        OverlaySync->>K8sAPI: Watch ConfigMap
        K8sAPI-->>OverlaySync: ConfigMap update
        OverlaySync->>OverlaySync: Write overlay to local file
        Gateway->>Gateway: Hot-reload overlay file
    end

    rect rgb(212, 239, 223)
        Note over Client, Backend: Flow 3: Inference Request (Data Plane)
        Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS, Bearer token
        Note over Gateway: Route via overlay
        Gateway->>Gateway: API format translation<br/>+ credential injection
        Gateway->>Backend: Forward request<br/>HTTPS mTLS
        Backend-->>Gateway: Inference response
        Gateway-->>Client: Response
    end
